\v 6 Why \add ≈have you¦127767 all been so stubborn\add* just¦127771 like¦127771 the Egyptians when¦127774 Pharaoh¦127774 made \add ≈them stubborn\add*? When \add @Yisrael's¦127780 god¦127780\add* dealt¦127780 severely with them¦127781, didn't¦127778 \add @the¦127782 Egyptians¦127782\add* send¦127782 \add @the¦127782 Israelis¦127782\add* away¦127782 and¦127783 they¦127783 went¦127783?
