\v 3 Then¦128187 Shemuel¦128188 told¦128187 all¦128191 the¦128193 \add ≈Israelis¦128194\add*, “If¦128196 you all \add really want\add* to return¦128202 to¦128203 Yahweh¦128205, remove¦128206 the¦128209 \add ≈foreign¦128210\add* gods¦128209 and the¦128210 Ashtorets from¦128211 \add ≈among¦128211 you¦128211\add*. Then \add ≈decide firmly to¦128215 serve¦128218\add* Yahweh¦128217 and¦128218 \add ≈no other\add*, then he'll¦128220 rescue¦128220 you¦128221 from¦128222 the Philistines'¦128223 \add ≈oppression\add*.”
